# As a-variable-is-held-to-the-one-symbol-that-link-names.ir, of a slot of a scope: compiled code alone fills it, and each store is held to the symbol that the type of the slot names.
# THE RED CONTROL. The lie, testing=UnseenCodeAnswersUndefined (false-proofs-are-stopped-where-the-value-comes-in.ir): Link takes what the shell's `id` gives for undefined, so nothing passes the test for a symbol,
# and `depth` is the one symbol that Link names. It printed "deep" for "wide" and went on.
# OPTIONS: testing=UnseenCodeAnswersUndefined
