# DOOR: PutEnvironmentField
# The reader asks nothing.
# RUN(READ): walk f3 mechanisms=-Inlining
# READ-NOT: TypeTest
# READ-NOT: ElemGet
# READ: key=symbol("depth")@m0:0
# RUN(ALL): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ALL-NOT: deep
# ALL-NOT: went on
# ALL: AOT: f{{*}} at {{*}}: what was captured is not of the type that the compiler has proven of it. It is: symbol. This is a bug in Bun.
# ALL: crashed with
# RUN(CALLS): run-in-shell mechanisms=-Inlining
# CALLS-NOT: deep
# CALLS-NOT: went on
# CALLS: AOT: f{{*}} at {{*}}: what was captured is not of the type that the compiler has proven of it. It is: symbol. This is a bug in Bun.
# CALLS: crashed with

